Package: simplehf
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: selective Hugging Face model repository downloader
 SimpleHF presents complete model repositories as expandable file trees and
 lets users select individual files or whole folders. It preserves repository
 paths and reports overall and per-file download progress.
